(2)   22/  C199B2 :                     ; at either the custom bg tile range (double-buffered, see BGActiveBuffer)
(2)   23/  C199B2 :                     ; or the default repeating pattern, depending on CustomBGLoaded. Also
(2)   24/  C199B2 :                     ; (re)applies the sprite's Z/Y/X. Safe to call again after the menu is
