(1)   31/  C1D0CE :                     
(1)   32/  C1D0CE : 41E8 0003               lea     3(a0),a0				; Move to filename string parameter
(1)   33/  C1D0D2 :                         ; Set filename to ASCII of game's NGH and append extension
