(1)   26/  C1D3DA :                         ; Load the in-game menu fix bank in fix bank #0 and the IGM palette
(1)   27/  C1D3DA :                         ; Let inserted code in SYSTEM_INT1 (IGMVBL) handle the UI
(1)   28/  C1D3DA :                         
